<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/e_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/surfaceForm> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity/HFrEF> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Thiazide diuretics can be used in patients with preserved renal function and mild symptoms of congestion. However, the majority of patients require loop diuretics (or combined with a thiazide diuretic and an MRA) due to the severity of HF symptoms and steadily deteriorating kidney function." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/tu_0057/locator> <http://digistrucmed.org/headerPath> "Supplementary Table 7" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/tu_0047> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Check adherence and fluid/salt intake." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/tu_0056> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Exclude use of other nephrotoxic agents, e.g. NSAIDs, trimethoprim." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_7/e_0118> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "diuretic" .
